# GridGame-Web-issues

Public product tracker. Code lives in private FE / BE / iOS repos. Agents work **one git repo at a time**.

## Launch labels

- `ready-for-dev` or `ready-for-frontend` **must be newly applied** to re-run the launcher (remove + re-add).
- Require `area:frontend` and/or `area:backend` (and optionally `area:ios`, human-gated).
- `cross-repo`: backend first, then add `ready-for-frontend`.
- Status (auto from FE/BE workflows when the PR cites `andyofengland/GridGame-Web-issues#N`):
  - launch OK → `in-dev`
  - PR open against `dev`/`main` → `in-review`
  - PR merged to `dev` → status cleared + comment (staging path)
  - PR merged to `main` → `shipped` + issue closed
  - launch failure → `agent:blocked`

## Do not

- Depend on issue-form YAML for in-game feedback — launcher keys off labels only.
- Put implementation code in this repo; open PRs in the private code repos against `dev`.

Secret: `CURSOR_API_KEY` on this repo. See `docs/DEV_PROMOTION.md`.
